{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simple lives of three young people.<br>A college student, a high schooler, and a working adult\u2014reliving each stage of life once more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person exploration adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. 1 hour to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese Horror / Exploration Adventure</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Unique Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monochrome visual style with all colors stripped away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal jump scares; emphasis on a supernatural worldview</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror experienced through unsettling sounds and spatial atmosphere</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Behind the Scenes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by a 20-year-old student.<br>All programming and design self-taught, completed in just one month.<br>Created with zero budget\u2014this is their second work, though unrelated to the first.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Stream</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allowed (Steam store page link must be included in the video description)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u9003\u907f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4055950/229bd94eca61cb72363246724e8984a1a6ef3aa4.jpg"},{"name":"\u53d7\u5bb9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4055950/47983cd44017de8b6831a970df698a8156d698d4.jpg"},{"name":"\u73fe\u5b9f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4055950/9cb857e8378ef4d0e75dbd8e39fe510d6a8081d3.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/i